"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Red Willow County runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 43 of those 75 years. In 2025, August to September hit 196% of normal while March to April sat at 46%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 6% of normal and January to February at 15%.</p>"}
